    <TD STYLE="padding: 3pt 5.4pt; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 58.1pt; text-indent: -58.1pt"><B>Article 6.</B> (Total Number of
